<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the specified integer on the effect
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>It should be noted that there is no maximum number of values on an effect, as the array of values on the effect expands as needed.
</p>
